@node Method_C__Auto_mount_at_Boot "Method C: Auto-mount at Boot"
@{i}Method C: Auto-mount at Boot@{ui}

Copy both @{fg shine}CF0@{fg text} and @{fg shine}CF0.info@{fg text} to @{fg shine}DEVS:DOSDrivers@{fg text}

----------------------------------------
