@node boot95 "boot95"
@{i}boot95@{ui}

Booting from FAT Partition
@{fg highlight}
  boot95 CF0:
@{fg text}

This installs an Amiga automount sequence in the unused area between the
MBR and first partition (~30KB). Requires fat95 in @{fg shine}L:@{fg text} drawer.

@{b}Caution:@{ub} Overwrites existing Amiga style partitioning info.

----------------------------------------
@{"<< Prev" link Debug95}  @{"Contents" link Main}  @{"Next >>" link lsfsres}

@endnode

